<title>POLAND: DROSED SEEKS MAIN MARKET LISTING.</title>
<headline>DROSED SEEKS MAIN MARKET LISTING.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish meat processor Drosed SA wants to move its shares to the main market from the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Drosed said its supervisory board approved a motion to apply to the Warsaw Stock Exchange on transferring the shares to the main market.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
